  "improvements": [
    "The guide no longer starts on an invisible car roof: floor probing honours hidden ancestors and no-floor objects, and the car starts at its actual pose.",
    "Exact source polygons, uncovered strips and courtyard holes replace the former overlap-drop and inset heuristics; valid surrounding buildings remain."
  ],
  "remainingGaps": [
    "The completed native Purple glass approach produces an almost fully occluded camera view. The endpoint, plaque sight line and nearby crowd/props require direct inspection.",
    "The Underground handler still fabricates an interior and an automatic camera descent; public access and a real interior have not been established. Replace this with a source-backed outdoor challenge.",
    "The totem-reading handler still awards for passive waiting; it needs an input-driven activity while preserving cultural attribution and real geometry.",
    "Pergola details, source-building heights, street furniture and the Chief Seattle fountain require matched independent whole-scene comparison.",
    "Raw audit findings remain for physical review: zfight 13."
  ],
